DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_B74B_B503';
<p>b74b_b503</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #6e5d00;">Gene M</span></strong> is analogous to the '<span style="color: #6e5d00;"><i>mushy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #6e5d00;">Gene M</span> feels soft to the touch and unusually squishy, unlike the usual firmness.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #186974;">Gene W</span></strong> is correlated with the '<span style="color: #186974;"><i>waxy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #186974;">Gene W</span> has a thick protective layer that is water resistant and opague.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #8c3c73;">Gene X</span></strong> is affiliated with the '<span style="color: #8c3c73;"><i>xanthic</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #8c3c73;">Gene X</span> has a fluorescent bright yellow coloring.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">mushy, waxy, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8ebb7; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #caf3fb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe0f0; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">12</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">mushy, waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8ebb7; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #caf3fb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8c3c73;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">35</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">mushy, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8ebb7; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #186974;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe0f0; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">676</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">mushy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8ebb7; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #186974;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8c3c73;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">385</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">waxy, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #6e5d00;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #caf3fb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe0f0; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">385</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #6e5d00;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #caf3fb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8c3c73;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">644</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #6e5d00;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #186974;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe0f0; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">53</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #6e5d00;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #186974;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8c3c73;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">10</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">2,200</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>Based on the traits expressed in the offspring, identify the <span style="color: DarkRed;"><strong>parental genotype combinations</strong></span>. These are the allele combinations that the parent fruit flies originally carried.</p> <p>More than one genotype will be correct. Select all that apply.</p>
PROMPT_B74B_B503
loadMacros('parserCheckboxList.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_B74B_B503_CHOICE_1';
mwx
LITERAL_B74B_B503_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_B74B_B503_CHOICE_2';
mw+
LITERAL_B74B_B503_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_B74B_B503_CHOICE_3';
m+x
LITERAL_B74B_B503_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_B74B_B503_CHOICE_4';
m++
LITERAL_B74B_B503_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_B74B_B503_CHOICE_5';
+wx
LITERAL_B74B_B503_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_B74B_B503_CHOICE_6';
+w+
LITERAL_B74B_B503_CHOICE_6
$choice_7 = <<'LITERAL_B74B_B503_CHOICE_7';
++x
LITERAL_B74B_B503_CHOICE_7
$choice_8 = <<'LITERAL_B74B_B503_CHOICE_8';
+++
LITERAL_B74B_B503_CHOICE_8
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_B74B_B503_CORRECT_1';
m+x
LITERAL_B74B_B503_CORRECT_1
$correct_2 = <<'LITERAL_B74B_B503_CORRECT_2';
+w+
LITERAL_B74B_B503_CORRECT_2
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6, $choice_7, $choice_8);
@correct = ($correct_1, $correct_2);
$answer = CheckboxList([@choices], [@correct], labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->checks\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
